♪ 'Cause I know ♪

01:51:14.633 --> 01:51:17.028
♪ No, you don't ♪

01:51:17.164 --> 01:51:20.002
♪ You don't scare ♪

01:51:23.777 --> 01:51:27.743
♪ Why should I go
the wrong way ♪

01:51:27.878 --> 01:51:31.145
♪ Down a one-way street ♪

01:51:34.114 --> 01:51:35.978
♪ Against the light ♪

01:51:36.113 --> 01:51:38.587
